<title>CROATIA: Croatia Oct currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatia Oct currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES    OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER    OCT '95</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	    4,390.3     4,367.4     3,001.7</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia     2,312.5     2,295.1     1,897.4</p>
<p> Commercial banks		 2,077.8     2,072.3     1,104.3</p>
<p>NOTE -- October central bank's reserves rose 17.4 percent from September and commercial bank's 5.5 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
